@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Public list teams
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipes/

### Public read one team
GET {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1

### Create a team for user 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1/equipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nova Team"
}

### Create same name again -> conflict expected
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1/equipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nova Team"
}

### Ask to join an existing team
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/2/equipes/rejoindre
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipeId": 1
}

### Leave team (provide remplacement when needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1/equipes/quitter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nouveauResponsableId": 2
}

### Promote member 2 as responsible in current user's team
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1/equipes/responsables/2/promouvoir

### Demote member 2 from responsible role
POST {{baseUrl}}/equipes/1/equipes/responsables/2/depromouvoir


